    pbDemoNoPatch: "Outlined by SAM 3.1 on {date} · no patches found", pbPatchNone: "none found", pbMeasNone: "no yellow or spotted part found (from the photo, SAM 3.1)", pbRemeasure: "Measure again with SAM 3.1", pbRemeasureS: "Admin only. SAM 3.1 measures this demo leaf again the current way; if it does not answer, the earlier measurement stays.", pbRemeasured: "Measured again and saved", pbRemeasureKept: "SAM 3.1 did not answer, so the earlier measurement stays",
    gdTab: "Guide", gdH: "How Khet Sathi works", gdLead: "A farm helper that watches your field from space, checks your poultry shed from phone videos, plans your yard and helps you sell. She speaks Bangla, Hindi and English.", gdWhatH: "What it does", gdC1H: "Your field from space", gdC1T: "The Sentinel-2 satellite photographs your field every 5 days to measure greenness. Soil moisture, rain and temperature come from Open-Meteo.", gdC1M: "{nField} · Sentinel-2", gdC2H: "Talk to Sathi", gdC2T: "Ask by voice or text in Bangla, Hindi or English. She shows each step of her work and where each number came from.", gdC2M: "{nSaathi} · Muse Spark", gdC3H: "The poultry shed", gdC3T: "From a phone video, SAM 3.1 counts the chickens and rings the ones that have not moved for a while.", gdC3M: "{nCams} · SAM 3.1", gdC4H: "A crop problem", gdC4T: "A photo of one leaf: SAM 3.1 measures how much of it is yellow or spotted. It is measured, never diagnosed.", gdC4M: "{nHome} · SAM 3.1", gdC5H: "The home yard", gdC5T: "One photo of the yard: what to plant now, how many, and a shopping list.", gdC5M: "{addAny} · SAM 3.1", gdC6H: "Sell and keep count", gdC6T: "Buyers' offers, your own selling rules, and the season's income and costs.", gdC6M: "{nMarket}, {nMoney}", gdStepsH: "How to do it, step by step", gdS1H: "Report a crop problem", gdS1: "On {nHome}, press {pbTake}. | Take a close photo of one leaf and wait for the measurement, then press {nextStep}. | Pick the plant, what you see, since when and how many plants. | Press {pbMake}, then {pbShare}, or {pbOffice}.", gdS2H: "Add your field", gdS2: "Press {addAny}, then {addField}. | Stand in the field and take a photo, or share your location, then press {find}. | Sathi finds the field on the satellite image and checks what covers it. | Pick what is growing, or let Sathi suggest what to plant.", gdS3H: "Add a poultry shed", gdS3: "Press {addAny}, then {addShed}. | Give the shed a name and about how many chickens it has. | On the {nCams} tab, add a short phone video of the shed: SAM 3.1 counts the birds.", gdS4H: "Add a home yard", gdS4: "Press {addAny}, then {addYard}. | Take one photo of the open space in front of the house. | Give the size and how much sun it gets. | Sathi says what to plant now, with a shopping list and nurseries nearby.", gdS5H: "Ask Sathi by voice", gdS5: "Open {nSaathi}. | Press the mic and speak in Bangla, Hindi or English, or type your question. | Sathi answers out loud and shows each step of her work and where each number came from.", gdS6H: "The weekly report", gdS6: "On {nHome}, press {repBtn}. | It covers every field, shed and yard: the last 7 days and the week ahead. | Send it on WhatsApp or save it as a PDF.", gdS7H: "Try the demo farm", gdS7: "Open the account menu (the round button, top right) and press {watchDemo}. | Everything works there, but nothing can be changed. | Press {backMyFarm} to go back.", gdRealH: "What is real, what is a demo", gdReal: "Real", gdRealT: "Satellite data (Sentinel-2), weather (Open-Meteo), crop data (MIRCA-OS, FAOSTAT), SAM 3.1 outlines, Sathi's answers (Muse Spark), and shops and offices from Google Maps.", gdDemo: "Demo, always labelled", gdDemoT: "Calls to buyers and services, sample prices, and the shed's sensor kit. Each one carries a demo or sample label.", gdNever: "Sathi never names a disease or a medicine. For a sick crop or bird she finds the nearest agriculture office or vet.", gdAgents: "For AI agents (Meta's Muse and others): the same steps, with the exact button names, are at",
